# Generated synthetic cases are reproducible from the seed, so the case tables
# themselves are not tracked: the confirmatory grid alone is 420 case folders of
# 11 CSVs each, and the test suite, sweeps and notebook add more.
generated/*

# The study-level artefacts are a different matter and ARE tracked. The frozen
# results store is the primary evidence of the results chapter and represents
# days of compute; regenerating it from seeds is possible but expensive, and
# losing it would make every reported number unreproducible. It is a few MB.
#
# Each level has to be re-included before its children can be: git will not
# look inside a directory it has already excluded.
!generated/study/
generated/study/*
!generated/study/results.jsonl
!generated/study/results.csv
!generated/study/meta.json
!generated/study/scip_results.jsonl
!generated/study/analysis/
!generated/study/results_mdbh.jsonl
!generated/study/meta_mdbh.json
!generated/study/analysis_mdbh/
!generated/study/results_equalfooting.jsonl
!generated/study/meta_equalfooting.json
!generated/study/analysis_equalfooting/
